    {
      "content": "By Jamie Ross and Hannah Jewell",
      "mime": "text/plain",
      "type": "byline",
      "authors": [
        {
          "id": "rossj2",
          "url": "https://www.washingtonpost.com/people/jamie-ross/",
          "name": "Jamie Ross",
          "bio": "Jamie Ross is a writer for The 7, The Washington Post’s morning briefing, which is available each weekday from 7 a.m. to 10 a.m. Eastern time on mobile, desktop and inboxes.",
          "expertise": "Newsletter writer focusing on U.S. and world news",
          "image": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/arc-authors/washpost/353f5fc4-cba0-4039-b9ad-170207e02f91.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "jewellh",
          "url": "https://www.washingtonpost.com/people/hannah-jewell/",
          "name": "Hannah Jewell",
          "bio": "Hannah Jewell writes The 7, The Washington Post’s morning briefing, and hosts The 7 podcast. She is also the author of \"We Need Snowflakes\" (2022),  \"100 Nasty Women of History\" (2017) and \"She Caused a Riot\" (2018). She joined The Post in 2017. ",
          "image": "https://s3.amazonaws.com/arc-authors/washpost/057ffd0a-e64a-495e-9990-26d70f2387fe.png"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "toggle",
      "subtype": "alerts",
      "key": "the7_briefs",
      "mime": "text/html"
    },
    {
      "arcId": "IPSLQD4BWNG6JB6CHNSGNYRDOQ",
      "type": "sanitized_html",
      "subtype": "subhead",
      "mime": "text/plain",
      "content": "1",
      "subhead_level": 2,
      "style": "briefs"
    },
    {
      "arcId": "FF6OZC4N2RC6ZCRSUZSOFEBDWM",
      "type": "sanitized_html",
      "subtype": "paragraph",
      "mime": "text/html",
      "content": "<b>Senators blocked an effort to make President Donald Trump end strikes on Iran.</b>",
      "style": "briefs"
    },
    {
      "arcId": "2WF33VC3JZCBTHLGA7DMFVC2XQ",
      "type": "list",
      "subtype": "unordered",
      "mime": "text/html",
      "content": [
        "<b>What happened? </b>Democrats forced a vote in an attempt to halt a war started without the consent of Congress. Only one Republican voted in favor and <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2026/03/04/senate-iran-war-powers-vote/\">one Democrat voted against</a>.",
        "<b>The latest: </b>Spain’s prime minister offered <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2026/03/04/pedro-sanchez-trump-war-feud-spain/\">a stinging criticism</a> of Trump’s war. And the conflict has cut the world off from <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/business/2026/03/05/qatar-energy-lng-iran-trump/\">a crucial energy source</a>, raising fears of a potential crisis.",
        "<b>From Hamas’s Oct. 7 attack to the latest war: </b>Violence is <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/world/2026/03/04/iran-israel-middle-east-future/\">forging a new Middle East</a>."
      ],
      "style": "briefs"
    },
    {
      "arcId": "AJ3LITHNZVFWBMOE2HFUV4C4NY",
      "type": "sanitized_html",
      "subtype": "subhead",
      "mime": "text/plain",
      "content": "exclusive",
      "subhead_level": 3,
      "style": "briefs"
    },
    {
      "arcId": "VXTDHTEHA5DFJOMGCG6GGKSNUM",
      "type": "sanitized_html",
      "subtype": "subhead",
      "mime": "text/plain",
      "content": "2",
      "subhead_level": 2,
      "style": "briefs"
    },
    {
      "arcId": "6DMRQZMDYNHZXBKNCKB62SBS4I",
      "type": "sanitized_html",
      "subtype": "paragraph",
      "mime": "text/html",
      "content": "<b>ICE is taking steps to shut down an immigrant detention camp at Fort Bliss.</b>",
      "style": "briefs"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "imageURL": "https://arc-anglerfish-washpost-prod-washpost.s3.amazonaws.com/public/W2RGMDGGKTKHPRMVYBICWQOV2A.JPG",
      "imageWidth": 4000,
      "imageHeight": 2667,
      "image_type": "photograph",
      "widthFactor": "full-bleed",
      "fullcaption": "Camp East Montana is a massive immigrant detention camp near the Mexican border in El Paso. (Paul Ratje/Reuters)",
      "blurb": "Camp East Montana is a massive immigrant detention camp near the Mexican border in El Paso."
    },
    {
      "arcId": "VJJWTZVMSZCLZOBIVSQ2GEDIYM",
      "type": "list",
      "subtype": "unordered",
      "mime": "text/html",
      "content": [
        "<b>According to an internal document: </b>Preparations are being made to close the Texas facility <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/immigration/2026/03/04/trump-administration-closes-fort-bliss-detention-center/\">less than eight months after it opened</a> as one of Trump’s marquee immigration projects.",
        "<b>Meanwhile, in Maryland: </b>Plans to convert a massive empty warehouse into an ICE detention center have worried and angered some residents <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/dc-md-va/2026/03/05/ice-detention-warehouses-williamsport/\">in a Trump-supporting county</a>."
      ],
      "style": "briefs"
    },
    {
      "arcId": "QVKZJOANQRDFPJSQCRM7ORDJKY",
      "type": "sanitized_html",
      "subtype": "subhead",
      "mime": "text/plain",
      "content": "3",
      "subhead_level": 2,
      "style": "briefs"
    },
    {
      "arcId": "BLGIEFHNMZBTRATJLFKUZVJUBA",
      "type": "sanitized_html",
      "subtype": "paragraph",
      "mime": "text/html",
      "content": "<b>Thousands of public comments slammed Trump’s White House ballroom plans.</b>",
      "style": "briefs"
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "imageURL": "https://arc-anglerfish-washpost-prod-washpost.s3.amazonaws.com/public/NSKDQSTYL5DFPC3XVO56VXIMEA.jpg",
      "imageWidth": 2048,
      "imageHeight": 1365,
      "image_type": "illustration",
      "widthFactor": "full-bleed",
      "fullcaption": "The comments represent a striking departure from how the president and his aides have depicted the ballroom. (Illustration by Chloe Meister/The Washington Post; Peter W. Stevenson, Salwan Georges/The Washington Post; NCPC)",
      "blurb": "The comments represent a striking departure from how the president and his aides have depicted the ballroom."
    },
    {
      "arcId": "OZYTHONGCVE73I5IVXSIS6PPNY",
      "type": "list",
      "subtype": "unordered",
      "mime": "text/html",
      "content": [
        "<b>Out of more than 35,000 comments: </b>More than 97% were critical of the plans — <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2026/03/05/white-house-ballroom-public-comments/\">read some here</a>. They were submitted ahead of <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2026/03/05/trump-ballroom-federal-review-panel/\">a pivotal review today</a> by a federal planning panel.",
        "<b>More Trump resistance: </b>A Trump-backed group involved in America’s 250th anniversary celebrations this summer <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/politics/2026/03/05/america-250-freedom-250-trump-celebration/\">has been receiving federal money</a>, alarming some watchdogs."
      ],
      "style": "briefs"
    },
    {
      "type": "ad",
      "breakpoints": [
        "small"
      ],
      "kind": "block",
      "size": "tall",
      "adPath": "/the-seven",
