    {
      "arcId": "MWI4HODBF5FH7IH6OUNYRMRTMQ",
      "type": "sanitized_html",
      "subtype": "subhead",
      "mime": "text/plain",
      "content": "7",
      "subhead_level": 2,
      "style": "briefs"
    },
    {
      "arcId": "627LK6M3NFCMFBPVIXQAZYSCQI",
      "type": "sanitized_html",
      "subtype": "paragraph",
      "mime": "text/html",
      "content": "<b>United Airlines announced a new rule to deal with a major flight annoyance.</b>",
      "style": "briefs"
    },
    {
      "arcId": "VOXXZB2HO5GB7AELOQY5DVJMUE",
      "type": "list",
      "subtype": "unordered",
      "mime": "text/html",
      "content": [
        "<b>Last week:</b> The carrier warned passengers that listening to audio without headphones can get them removed from a plane. The updated policy <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/travel/2026/03/05/united-airlines-headphones/\">has some customers cheering</a>.",
        "<b>Need travel inspiration?</b> Average hotel rates in Paris are rising, so our reporter tried a $100-a-night room and was pleasantly surprised. Find her budget hotel tips <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/travel/tips/best-budget-paris-hotels/\">here</a>."
      ],
      "style": "briefs"
    },
    {
      "arcId": "7CQPSRJLBFFUNONT5WCMY2D3QQ",
      "type": "sanitized_html",
      "subtype": "paragraph",
      "mime": "text/html",
      "content": "<b>And now … two good news stories: </b>How a crew of movers <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/lifestyle/2026/03/04/missing-girl-amber-alert-movers-arizona/\">helped to rescue a missing toddler</a>. <b>Plus:</b> <a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/video/national/two-people-rescued-from-hot-air-balloon-tangled-in-tower/2026/03/03/98b63e60-5ad4-40fc-b916-05e3af891ec2_video.html\">Watch a daring rescue</a> after a hot-air balloon got tangled in a tower.",
      "style": "briefs"
    },
